WEBVTT

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:06.881
The Ace to Five of Wands cover the start of a venture,
from the first spark to the friction that follows.

00:00:06.881 --> 00:00:09.478
Each card has an upright and a reversed
meaning.

00:00:10.778 --> 00:00:11.642
Ace of Wands.

00:00:11.642 --> 00:00:13.835
Beginnings, inspiration, a spark.

00:00:13.835 --> 00:00:18.487
In the RWS image a hand emerges from a
cloud holding a sprouting wand.

00:00:19.787 --> 00:00:20.589
Two of Wands.

00:00:20.589 --> 00:00:22.564
Planning, choice, looking ahead.

00:00:22.564 --> 00:00:27.624
A figure stands on a battlement holding a
small globe, with a wand at either side.

00:00:29.024 --> 00:00:31.367
Have a tarot spread in front of you?

00:00:31.367 --> 00:00:36.118
Photograph it at readmyspread.com, and get
a clear reading, card by card.
